@* Thẻ phim chi tiết cho danh sách/tìm kiếm V2 (theo Stitch): poster + badge chất lượng/ngôn ngữ, năm • thời lượng, ★ điểm, tên, thể loại.
   Model: (Movie, poster URL đã xử lý). Chỉ hiện trường có dữ liệu thật. *@
@model (MovieWeb.Models.Entities.Movie Movie, string Poster)
@{
    var m = Model.Movie;
    var ep = MovieWeb.Helpers.EpisodeStatus.Format(m.EpisodeCurrent, m.EpisodeTotal);
    var meta = string.Join(" • ", new[] { m.Year?.ToString(), string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Time) ? null : m.Time }.Where(x => !string.IsNullOrEmpty(x)));
}
<article class="movie-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low transition-colors hover:bg-surface-container">
    <a href="/phim/@m.Slug" class="movie-card-poster relative block aspect-[2/3] overflow-hidden bg-surface-container">
        <img src="@MovieWeb.Helpers.ImageHelper.Webp(Model.Poster, 400)" srcset="@MovieWeb.Helpers.ImageHelper.WebpSrcSet(Model.Poster, 200, 400)" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 16vw, (min-width: 768px) 22vw, 45vw" alt="@m.Name" width="400" height="600" loading="lazy"
             class="v2-img h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 "
             onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/images/default-poster.jpg';" />
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Quality))
        {
            <span class="absolute left-2 top-2 rounded bg-surface-container-high/90 px-2 py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface backdrop-blur-md">@m.Quality</span>
        }
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Language))
        {
            <span class="absolute right-2 top-2 rounded bg-secondary-container/90 px-2 py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-on-secondary-container backdrop-blur-md">@m.Language</span>
        }
        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(ep))
        {
            <span class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 right-2 truncate rounded bg-background/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary backdrop-blur-sm">@ep</span>
        }
        <span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-background/40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-container text-[28px] text-on-primary-container" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">play_arrow</span>
        </span>
    </a>
    <div class="movie-card-body flex flex-1 flex-col gap-1 p-space-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
            <span class="truncate">@meta</span>
            @if (m.Rating is > 0)
            {
                <span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-0.5 font-bold text-secondary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>@m.Rating.Value.ToString("0.0")</span>
            }
        </div>
        <h3 class="truncate font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-surface transition-colors group-hover:text-primary" title="@m.Name"><a href="/phim/@m.Slug">@m.Name</a></h3>
        @if (m.Categories?.Any() == true)
        {
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                @foreach (var c in m.Categories.Take(2))
                {
                    <span class="rounded bg-surface-container-high px-1.5 py-0.5 font-label-sm text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">@c.Name</span>
                }
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</article>
